RECOMMENDED ACTIONS

1. Sunset Static Posts and Shift to 100% Video Reels: Post exclusively Reel content during the peak engagement window of 6:00 PM to 9:00 PM IST. Eliminating low-performing static image posts will help maximize algorithm distribution.

2. Launch a Serialized Storytelling Format: Create a 3-part challenge reel series modeled after successful competitor formats (e.g., "Building an AI Agent to Solve [Real Business Problem] in 24 Hours"). Frame the hook around money, time saved, or real business impact before introducing the technical build.

3. Live Build Demos of High-Star GitHub Releases: Replace static feature breakdown videos with screen-record workflow breakdowns of trending open-source tools (like Claude Code, Artemis, or Agency Agents). Show the setup step-by-step rather than just listing capabilities.
